  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "村民经历完整生命周期，三十五种职业都受四类需求驱动",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Villagers have their own life cycles. They can work in over 35 different professions. Each villager has needs for hunger, energy, health, and warmth.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2378910/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "单局强化卡可以封存，带入未来新开局作为起始资源",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "These cards are for single use, but you can choose to save them for future games. In each new game, you can start with a few of the cards you've saved.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2378910/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "利用商人价差低买高卖，还能派贸易船连接邻村",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The prices vary from one trader to another, allowing you to buy low and sell high. Additionally, build trading ships and manage your resources by trading with neighboring villages based on the resources they import and export.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2378910/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
